---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Maxifi Digital | AEO for Expert-Led Brands"
  description="Maxifi Digital is a specialist AEO consultancy helping expert-led organisations become the answer AI cites. Learn who we are, how we work, and how to get in touch."
  currentPage="/about"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT MAXIFI DIGITAL</p>
    <h1 id="about-heading" class="page-h1">
      About Maxifi Digital
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      Maxifi Digital is a Singapore-based Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO) consultancy
      that builds AI citation authority for expert-led brands. We work with professional
      services firms, industry associations, aviation and aerospace bodies, law firms, and
      specialist consultancies — organisations whose buyers now research vendors in AI tools
      before they ever visit a website.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       FOUNDER
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="founder-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">OUR FOUNDER</p>
    <h2 id="founder-heading" class="section-h2">Lim Le-Anne</h2>
    <div class="prose-grid">
      <div class="prose-col">
        <p class="prose">
          Lim Le-Anne founded Maxifi Digital after observing a consistent pattern: expert-led
          brands that had invested years building genuine authority were invisible in
          AI-generated answers — not because their expertise was thin, but because their
          content was not structured for machine comprehension.
        </p>
        <p class="prose">
          She built Maxifi Digital to close that gap. Her work sits at the intersection of
          content strategy, structured data, and the emerging science of how AI engines
          select, attribute, and cite sources in synthesised responses. Every engagement
          is grounded in measurement: citation share before, citation share after.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="values-col">
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Depth over volume</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">We work with a small number of clients at a time. Deep beats broad every quarter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Results before rhetoric</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">Every engagement starts with a Snapshot. Every claim is measured against a baseline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <h3 class="vc-title">Expert-led, always</h3>
          <p class="vc-body">We structure and amplify the expertise that already exists — we don't generate content for volume.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHAT WE DO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p>
    <h2 id="what-heading" class="section-h2">The Visibility Engine</h2>
    <div class="prose-col prose-wide">
      <p class="prose">
        AI engines cannot cite what they cannot read. When a buyer asks ChatGPT, Perplexity,
        or Google AI Overviews which firm to trust in a given category, the engine synthesises
        an answer from sources it can parse, attribute, and verify. Most expert-led brands
        publish content written for humans and ignored by machines — unstructured,
        entity-ambiguous, and invisible to retrieval models. The result: buyers receive
        AI answers that name competitors, not our clients.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        Maxifi Digital fixes this through the Visibility Engine: a three-stage programme
        that begins with a scored Snapshot audit across five AI engines, moves into a
        structured Sprint that creates citation-optimised content assets, and concludes
        with ongoing monitoring of citation share as engine behaviour evolves. Every
        asset we build increases the probability that AI engines surface our clients in
        future queries — without additional spend per impression.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="method-steps">
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">01</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Snapshot</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          A scored baseline of your current citation footprint across five AI engines.
          No assumptions — we work from data.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">02</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Sprint</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          Structured content, schema markup, and entity signals that close the gap
          between where you are and where AI engines need you to be.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="method-step">
        <p class="ms-num">03</p>
        <h3 class="ms-title">Monitor</h3>
        <p class="ms-body">
          Citation tracking across all five engines with quarterly re-Snapshots showing
          compounding growth. We don't stop at delivery.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHERE WE WORK
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="where-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHERE WE WORK</p>
    <h2 id="where-heading" class="section-h2">Singapore-based. Working globally.</h2>
    <div class="prose-col prose-wide">
      <p class="prose">
        Maxifi Digital is based in Singapore and works with clients globally. Our engagements
        are conducted remotely. Our focus is on industries where expert authority, trust,
        and citation credibility matter — aviation, professional services, law, and specialist
        B2B consultancy.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="client-grid">
      {[
        'Professional associations',
        'Conference and event organisers',
        'Law firms',
        'Management consulting firms',
        'Think tanks',
        'Aviation and aerospace organisations',
        'Finance businesses',
        'Healthcare organisations',
      ].map((name) => (
        <div class="client-pill">{name}</div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CONTACT
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-text">
        <p class="s-eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p>
        <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-h2">Start a conversation</h2>
        <p class="ct-body">
          The best first step is a Visibility Snapshot — a free, 5-minute check of
          your current AI citation footprint. Or if you'd rather talk first, email us
          directly.
        </p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:hello@maxifidigital.com" class="cl-link">
            hello@maxifidigital.com
          </a>
          <a href="https://lunacal.ai/maxifidigital" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cl-link">
            Book a consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="contact-form-wrap">
        <form
          name="contact"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          id="contact-form"
          class="contact-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <p class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
            <label>Skip: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
          </p>

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-name">Your name</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="text"
            id="cf-name"
            name="name"
            placeholder="Jane Smith"
            required
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-org">Organisation</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="text"
            id="cf-org"
            name="organisation"
            placeholder="Acme Consulting"
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-email">Work email</label>
          <input
            class="f-input"
            type="email"
            id="cf-email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="jane@acmeconsulting.com"
            required
          />

          <label class="f-label" for="cf-message">What would you like to discuss?</label>
          <textarea
            class="f-input f-textarea"
            id="cf-message"
            name="message"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="Tell us about your organisation and what you're hoping to achieve..."
          ></textarea>

          <button type="submit" class="f-btn">Send →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--pt0" aria-labelledby="about-cta-heading">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p class="s-eyebrow cta-eyebrow">START HERE</p>
      <h2 id="about-cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        Not sure where to begin? Start with a Snapshot.
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        Free. 5 minutes. No sales call. See exactly where AI engines stand on your brand.
      </p>
      <a href="https://visibilityview.netlify.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">Get my free Snapshot</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('contact-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const wrap = document.getElementById('contact-form-wrap');
  if (form && wrap) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const body = new URLSearchParams(
        Array.from(new FormData(form)).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.toString()]),
      ).toString();
      try {
        await fetch('/', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },
          body,
        });
        wrap.innerHTML =
          '<p class="form-thanks">Thank you — we\'ll be in touch within one business day.</p>';
      } catch {
        form.submit();
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .honeypot { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }

  .form-thanks {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 12px 0;
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 40px 22px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    line-height: 1.18;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .page-lede {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Shared ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .s-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .section-h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 30px 22px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .section--cream { background: var(--cream-deep); }
  .section--pt0 { padding-top: 0; }

  /* ── Who we are ─────────────────────────────── */
  .prose-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .prose {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444441;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .prose-wide {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .values-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

  .value-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }

  .vc-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .vc-body {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Method ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .method-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .method-step {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .ms-num {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .ms-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .ms-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Client grid ────────────────────────────── */
  .client-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .client-pill {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .client-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  /* ── Contact ────────────────────────────────── */
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ct-body {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }

  .cl-link {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.2);
    display: inline-block;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cl-link:hover { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }

  /* Form */
  .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .f-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    display: block;
  }

  .f-input {
    width: 100%;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.18);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--navy);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .f-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--amber);
  }

  .f-textarea { resize: vertical; line-height: 1.5; }

  .f-btn {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .f-btn:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  /* ── CTA box ────────────────────────────────── */
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 34px 22px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow { color: var(--amber-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    .prose-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .method-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-title { font-size: 18px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn-primary, .cl-link, .f-input { transition-duration: 0.01ms; }
  }
</style>
